# Project: ApnaShop365.in (fancy jewelry storefront, frontend only)

## Stack
- React.js (Vite), plain JavaScript, Material UI v5+, Redux Toolkit,
  React Router, react-helmet-async
- No backend, no database, no auth, no payment gateway

## Architecture rules
- Business facts (phone, social links, address, policy text, delivery charge)
  live ONLY in src/config/siteConfig.js. Never hardcode them in components.
- Unknown facts must be marked with // TODO: comments, never invented.
- Products and categories come from src/data/*.json via ProductService only.
- Redux is used ONLY for cart and cart-drawer UI state.
- Non-UI logic uses classes: ProductService, WhatsAppLinkBuilder,
  PriceFormatter, CartPersistence.
- UI components are small, reusable, and presentational.

## Style rules
- Mobile-first. Test at 360px width first.
- Colors and fonts come from src/theme/theme.js only.
- Accessible: alt text, aria-labels, keyboard navigation.
- No console errors or warnings. Keep code ESLint-clean.
- Short, useful comments only.

## Workflow rules
- Work phase by phase. After each phase, run `npm run build` and fix errors
  before moving on.
- Do not skip files or leave "implement later" stubs.
- Do not add features outside the brief.